        -: 9899:A port of R 4.6.1's stats::density.default(), together with the five bandwidth
        -: 9900:rules its `bw =` string can name, so that a Perl caller gets the same grid, the
        -: 9901:same bandwidth and the same estimate R would give.
        -: 9902:
        -: 9903:Every piece below is named after, and follows line by line, the R source it
        -: 9904:comes from:
        -: 9905:
