        -: 9914:  src/library/stats/src/zeroin.c     which is ft_zeroin() above already
        -: 9915:
        -: 9916:R disperses the data onto a grid, convolves it with the discretised kernel
        -: 9917:using fft(), and interpolates back with approx().  It rounds n up to a power of
        -: 9918:two precisely so that transform is cheap, which means the transform length here
