        -:11357:
        -:11358:# Row-level de-duplication core for drop_duplicates().  The Perl wrapper
        -:11359:# validates the frame, rejects HoH, and resolves `subset` into an ordered
        -:11360:# list of column identifiers (integer positions for AoA, names for AoH/HoA).
        -:11361:#   shape: 1 = AoH, 3 = AoA, 4 = HoA
        -:11362:#   subset: arrayref of the columns whose cells define a row's identity
        -:11363:#   keep:  1 = first occurrence, -1 = last occurrence, 0 = drop every dup
        -:11364:# survivors are shared, not deep-copied: AoA/AoH reuse the original row refs
        -:11365:# (like dropna), HoA builds new column arrays over the same cell SVs.
        -:11366:#
